ty }{[{5}^{-x}]}_{0}^{a} \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡(5)}\\cdot ({lim}_{a\\to \\infty }\\frac{1}{{5}^{a}}-1)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, recall the end behavior of the function $y=\\frac{1}{{5}^{x}},$ shown in the graph below:\n\n- ${lim}_{x\\to -\\infty }\\frac{1}{{5}^{x}}=\\infty $\n\n- ${lim}_{x\\to \\infty }\\frac{1}{{5}^{x}}=0$\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14037234/assets/5949cbdface45cf103ae5bbd14db5d81917c19f3ef82417216e26d2064ca6bd1.png)\n\nUsing this to evaluate our integral, we conclude that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }{5}^{-x}\\,\\text{d}x & =-\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡(5)}\\cdot ({lim}_{a\\to \\infty }\\frac{1}{{5}^{a}}-1) \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡(5)}\\cdot (0-1) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡(5)}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534648 true] [17592186301333 1000 #edb/ref 17592186301334 13194139534648 true] [17592186301333 1000 #edb/ref 17592186301335 13194139534648 true] [17592186301333 1000 #edb/ref 17592186301336 13194139534648 true] [17592186301333 1000 #edb/ref 17592186301337 13194139534648 true] [17592186301333 1000 #edb/ref 17592186301338 13194139534648 true] [17592186301333 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534648 true] [17592186301333 1041 "selection" 13194139534648 true] [17592186301333 1104 #edb/ref 17592186301338 13194139534648 true] [17592186301333 1110 #uuid "7e0ff1bb-d49d-5f2a-b53d-b9a7ac2b1026" 13194139534648 true] [17592186301334 1034 "\\frac{1}{{e}^{5}}" 13194139534648 true] [17592186301334 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534648 true] [17592186301334 1111 #uuid "7c5dcbf9-e43b-5d89-bc98-77878fbe3b29" 13194139534648 true] [17592186301335 1034 "1" 13194139534648 true] [17592186301335 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534648 true] [17592186301335 1111 #uuid "c2bf7242-1dfb-548a-bc3a-a20d63749525" 13194139534648 true] [17592186301336 1034 "\\frac{1}{5}" 13194139534648 true] [17592186301336 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534648